WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.260
Ce jeu de couple

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.651
a failli nous séparer.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:05.988
Attends…

00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:06.402
pourquoi tu me

00:00:06.402 --> 00:00:07.209
montres du doigt ?

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:07.710
Parce que

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:08.761
c'est évident !

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.320
Et le cadeau

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.573
perdu par la poste ?

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:13.510
Et toi,

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:13.850
« j'arrive dans

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:14.652
cinq minutes » ?!

00:00:21.643 --> 00:00:22.543
…Ton rire.

00:00:25.197 --> 00:00:25.629
…Ok.

00:00:25.629 --> 00:00:27.008
Question suivante.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:27.993
Et vous,

00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:28.770
quelle question

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:29.758
a lancé la guerre ?
